ble, is it confirmed that some of the providers (like Okta), sets the email verified in the user info?\r\n\r\nQuestion for further improvement, is there more info we potentially should \"fall back\" to getting from userinfo if we dont get it in the claim?\r\n\r\nCould you please add a changelog entry?","commit_id":"eaec48d3606bbfdea1322ca97d9df1dd59ccb609","state":"approved","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2493#pullrequestreview-2705143074","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2493","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2493#pullrequestreview-2705143074"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2493"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-21T08:46:09Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T08:46:33Z","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","event":"reviewed"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/2743964663","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2493#issuecomment-2743964663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2493","id":2743964663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz886jjZP3","user":{"login":"benley","id":1432730,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzI3MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1432730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley","html_url":"https://github.com/benley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T17:07:56Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T17:07:56Z","body":"> I think this looks reasonable, is it confirmed that some of the providers (like Okta), sets the email verified in the user info?\r\n\r\nOkta's knowledge base indicates that they do this (https://support.okta.com/help/s/article/how-to-return-the-email-verified-claim), and I have confirmed the behavior through live testing. The only other one I've tested is Keycloak, but keycloak also includes email_verified in the id token response.\r\n\r\n> Question for further improvement, is there more info we potentially should \"fall back\" to getting from userinfo if we dont get it in the claim?\r\n\r\nGood question!  In theory we could try UserInfo for any of the standard claims that headscale uses: name, email, picture, preferred_username.\r\n\r\n> Could you please add a changelog entry?\r\n\r\nYes, coming right up.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/2743964663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"benley","id":1432730,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzI3MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1432730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley","html_url":"https://github.com/benley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benley/repos","events